            "style": "claude",
            "title": "A rival view",
            "text": "Elizabeth Eisenstein (*The Printing Press as an Agent of Change*, 1979) gives the press the leading role; Andrew Pettegree argues that pamphlets mattered more than books."
          }
        ],
        "blocks": [
          {
            "kind": "heading",
